# P3: ALL07 (Hawaii / Pearl Harbor) won with real orders only (no cheats).
# '_Win Occurred' = DestroyedBuildingsAll(BadGuy1) (event 10, house buildings
# <= 0, docs/re/map-triggers.md). At the start BadGuy1 owns ONE building: the
# Sentry Gun outpost at (92,206); its Niihau base only appears after Niihau
# falls (SMCV 'Niihau Invaders MCV'). After the intro lock (48 s) the player
# selects the whole Pearl fleet (Destroyers + Aegis + Carriers, T twice) and
# orders an attack on that sentry; the Carriers' Hornets kill it on the way
# and the mission is WON at ~3:20 game time.
set render_every 3000
set on_quit continue
set campaign ALL07t.MAP GDI
until 60 scene == campaign-load
click start
until 300 scene == game
wait 30
until 1500 input_locked == 0
assert buildings(1) == 1
assert buildings(1,NALASR) == 1
view cell 92 206
if units(0,DEST) > 0 then click unit 0:DEST:0
if units(0,AEGIS) > 0 then click unit 0:AEGIS:0 shift
if units(0,CARRIER) > 0 then click unit 0:CARRIER:0 shift
key t
key t
assert selected >= 7
click building 1:NALASR:0
wait 600
dump
until 3000 buildings(1) == 0
assert outcome == RUNNING or outcome == WON
until 600 outcome == WON
end expect WON
